            <description><![CDATA[<h2>A smoother light switch</h2>
<ul>
  <li><b>Theme changes now fade.</b> Switching between the light and dark themes cross-fades smoothly — like a light dimming up or down — instead of snapping all at once.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
